    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "FRONTIER\nTimetable\nSystem Timetable Includes: Air Midwest\nEffective September 4, 1985",
      "IT SEEMS WE'VE\nMADE A LOT OF NEW\nFRIENDS LATELY.\nDuring the past few weeks, we've seen lots of new faces. People\ndiscovering for themselves the kind of service and convenient\nscheduling regular Frontier flyers have known about for years.\nIf you're one of the people who trusted Frontier during this\nconfusing travel time, we thank you. And we invite you to continue\nto fly Frontier. Because it's in times like these you find out who\nyour friends really are.\nCall your travel agent or Frontier.\nTake off with an old friend.\nFRONTIER\n015.12"
    ],
